#sortorder:1
#showas:Neinzul 世仇
This hard scenario has the Necromancer facing two AIs along with two rival Wild Hives. 

The Speedster (diff 8) AI features fast ships and uses devices to increase their speed. The Neinzul Enthusiast (diff 8) predominantly uses Neinzul ships and has nests scattered across the galaxy, which will release Neinzul swarms should you stray on these planets.

The Wild Hives are normally docile are their own, but they will fight aggressively over the same territory. We have Neinzul Sappers allies to support our defenses. 

A Nanocaust invasion will arrive after a few hours. Fortunately, the Necromancer is unusually resistant to their nanocaustization.